comment = "bhyve virtio-vsock and AF_VSOCK test suite"

desc = <<EOD
Device-level ATF/Kyua tests for the bhyve virtio-vsock host device and
end-to-end (host<->guest) test tooling and driver scripts for the AF_VSOCK
socket domain, installed in /usr/tests/sys/kern.  This package also depends on
the base and MAC capability test packages used by the complete vsock runner.
EOD
